### 1. Create Account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Account",
  "initialCash": 20000
}



### Buy 10 AAPL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 10
}

### 3. Sell $100 of AAPL
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/transactions



### Dividend / DRIP Final Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/market/morning


### 1. Create Entitlements
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/dividends/entitlements


### 2. Process Dividend Payments / DRIP
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/dividends/payments


### 3. Check Transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/transactions


### 4. Check Portfolio
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/portfolio